  Sooo there's no verifiable record of
  Lance Twiggs—no addresses, licenses,
  or history. His name only appears in
  press coverage of the Kirk shooting.
  The figure that does exist is Jerry Tyler
  Twiggs, a St. George pediatrician tied to
  Intermountain Healthcare through Dixie
  Pediatrics. Intermountain runs
  pediatrics, psychiatry, and crisis
  programs, making it a prime recipient of
  new behavioral-health funding.
  Public records show Jerry with multiple
  aliases and residences across several
  states, plus relatives tied to medical-
  supply and behavioral-health ventures.
  This positions the family in both clinical
  services and supply chains-exactly
  where funding flows after a high-profile
  "mental health crisis."
  When Jerry surfaced in the media as the
  "grandfather" of Lance, it placed a
  verifiable figure with deep medical ties
  at the center of the story. His presence
  connected the event to an established
  network in pediatrics and behavioral
  health, positioned to gain from new
  funding.
